{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01080",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.01,
      "end_seconds": 5.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Afternoon, doctor. They're in and comfortable, and I have the measurements ready."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.07,
      "end_seconds": 12.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "Great. Hello, come in and sit down. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.57,
      "end_seconds": 17.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.22,
      "end_seconds": 21.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Absolutely, come and sit beside them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 22.02,
      "end_seconds": 25.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "She's been having hot flushes, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.9,
      "end_seconds": 28.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Right, when did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.27,
      "end_seconds": 32.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "I've, I've had it for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.53,
      "end_seconds": 39.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.16,
      "end_seconds": 66.99,
      "duration_seconds": 26.83,
      "text": "I'd give it a eight, out of ten. I get some relief from a fan. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it. I've had night sweats too, uh, for two months. And vaginal dryness, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.87,
      "end_seconds": 72.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.58,
      "end_seconds": 87.92,
      "duration_seconds": 15.34,
      "text": "Heart failure, for nearly five years. I have gout, for about ten years. Arthritis in my knees, for about ten years. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.48,
      "end_seconds": 96.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Right, so gout is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.3,
      "end_seconds": 113.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.16,
      "end_seconds": 119.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "I take furosemide, 40 milligrams, maybe, every morning for the fluid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.26,
      "end_seconds": 124.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Is the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.67,
      "end_seconds": 138.66,
      "duration_seconds": 12.99,
      "text": "Uh, no, it's at home. I take febuxostat, 80 milligrams, once a day for the gout. Paracetamol. I take it 650 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.8,
      "end_seconds": 142.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.99,
      "end_seconds": 145.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "My brother has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.53,
      "end_seconds": 150.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.37,
      "end_seconds": 158.23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.86,
      "text": "Yes, um, I had a caesarean for my second baby, nine years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.41,
      "end_seconds": 161.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.55,
      "end_seconds": 167.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.87,
      "end_seconds": 171.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.1,
      "end_seconds": 177.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.52,
      "end_seconds": 183.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.72,
      "end_seconds": 189.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Ah, no, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.37,
      "end_seconds": 199.5,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any heavy bleeding, chest pain or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.22,
      "end_seconds": 203.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.28,
      "end_seconds": 209.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "So, any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.14,
      "end_seconds": 212.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 213.15,
      "end_seconds": 223.44,
      "duration_seconds": 10.29,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Heart rate 76, blood pressure 126 over 75, saturation 98 percent. Temperature is 36.7 degrees, respiratory rate 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.85,
      "end_seconds": 225.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.61,
      "end_seconds": 231.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.54,
      "end_seconds": 234.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.13,
      "end_seconds": 244.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.09,
      "end_seconds": 251.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.26,
      "end_seconds": 275.49,
      "duration_seconds": 8.23,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, it points towards menopausal symptoms. I can't rule out an overactive thyroid yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.36,
      "end_seconds": 280.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.81,
      "end_seconds": 316.51,
      "duration_seconds": 34.7,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's menopausal symptoms, and we'll know more once the a thyroid test is back. Let's get a thyroid test, for hot flushes. We'll begin with estradiol patch, 50 micrograms, twice weekly, long term. That should help with menopausal symptoms. Dress in layers and keep the bedroom cool. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.57,
      "end_seconds": 322.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, that's fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.8,
      "end_seconds": 336.13,
      "duration_seconds": 12.33,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. I'd like you back in three months. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.65,
      "end_seconds": 340.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.21,
      "end_seconds": 343.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}